.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338220/extras/7e6e8d29019ce61485d859f27503804e.poster.avif?t=1680266785\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338220/extras/7e6e8d29019ce61485d859f27503804e.webm?t=1680266785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338220/extras/7e6e8d29019ce61485d859f27503804e.mp4?t=1680266785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Light attacks are as quick as your fingers and give you air time.<br></li><li> Heavy attacks have a cooldown but deal extra damage and fling you upwards.<br></li><li> Collect soul charges to unleash a powerful slash attack, but beware: enemies you kill with it won't reward you with more soul charges.<br></li><li> Use the environment to your advantage with wall jumps and dashes to speed towards enemies as they appear.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338220/extras/aa9bfaf050a3f299b7f019f624d1a4c7.webp?t=1680266785\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338220/extras/c61a1a2c0e617ad60257c880e595cfdf.avif?t=1680266785\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Compete for the top of the leaderboard, where every second counts.<br></li><li> Watch replays of leaderboard scores to discover new techniques.<br></li><li> Custom engine with minimal hardware requirements.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338220/extras/aa9bfaf050a3f299b7f019f624d1a4c7.webp?t=1680266785\" /></span><br><br>Playing with a controller is highly recommended. Music by Peritune. Voice effects by Voicevox.",
